5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us ensure we look beyond the numbers to the people who make the science possible.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! This is like a treasure hunt! I want to see where the money actually goes and what it buys these days!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I think... maybe we should check if the previous projects actually finished what they promised.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I don't care about the pleasantries. We need to know why projects keep stalling. I'm looking for the real bottlenecks.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,Let us remain focused. We must evaluate the infrastructure's capacity to support a new award without collapsing under the pressure.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, Takumi. The truth reveals itself to those who listen. I shall look into the human element of these labs.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, you're so grumpy! Maybe you just need a snack! I'm going to peek at the ledgers to see the secrets!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just don't want us to make a mistake again. I'll look at the old files.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, stop joking. @Daisuke, that's too passive. We need to see where the actual interruptions happen before we commit.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I agree with the need for efficiency, but we must look at the shared services first. That is where the real risk lies.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,Indeed. A project is only as strong as the hands that guide the instruments. I will seek the truth of the staffing.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I wonder if the agency is hiding something! Hehe! I'll check the facility rates too, just to be sure!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll just do my part. I hope it helps.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm not waiting for a consensus. I'm going to find out exactly where the time is being wasted.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will proceed with my investigation into the shared facilities and the national computing agreements.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us move forward with a spirit of generosity and wisdom. I am ready.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Me too! Let's find some clues!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay... I'm ready.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Finally. Let's get this over with.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,Agreed. Let us see what the data reveals.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
