35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a sobering reminder that while funds are fleeting, the loss of skilled hands is a wound that takes years to heal.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh! I found something! The agency still pays for the glasshouse, but shipping things is getting super expensive!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I found that the ""flashy"" projects often didn't finish their goals. The simpler ones actually lasted longer.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,It's exactly what I thought. The equipment is breaking and there's no one to fix it. We're losing months to basic maintenance.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The computing capacity is stable, but the glasshouse is completely saturated. Any project requiring plant space will face immediate delays.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, your frustration is a sign of your passion. But remember, we cannot blame the machine for the absence of the mechanic.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Minako, wait! If the agency pays for the glasshouse, does that mean the awardee doesn't have to? That's a big deal!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm worried... if we pick a project that looks ""promising"" but is too complex, it might just stall like the others did.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, passion doesn't fix a broken spectrometer. If we fund a project that needs that suite, it's a waste of money.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,The cost of animal units has risen. We must ensure the candidate has the budget to cover these new rates or the project will fail.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,We must look for the candidate whose needs align with the hands we actually have. The glasshouse crew is strong; the technicians are gone.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I want to pick someone who doesn't need to ship a million things! That would save so much money for other fun stuff!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,Maybe... maybe we should pick the one that is most realistic? Even if it's not the most exciting one?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm not picking anyone who relies on the shared instrumentation suite. It's a death trap for a schedule.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,We must balance the ambition of the research with the reality of the facility bookings. The glasshouse is a hard limit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us be the bridge between the dream of the scientist and the reality of the lab. We shall find the right fit.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm ready to pick! I hope it's someone who knows how to save money!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll try to be brave and vote for what I think is safest.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,Just don't pick a project that's going to get stuck in a queue for six months.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,I have a clear view of the constraints. Let us see the candidates.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
